stance evaluation\n\u2022 Welding quality scoring\n\u2022 Weld area and checkpoint validation\n\u2022 Overheating detection\n\u2022 Incorrect welding area detection\n\u2022 Hole detection\n\u2022 Training completion tracking\n\u2022 Training session history\n\u2022 Performance scores and results\n\nThe simulator evaluates important welding parameters during training and provides performance feedback based on the configured training criteria.\n\nKN Welding Simulator is designed for welding training, skill development, demonstrations, and educational use. It provides a repeatable virtual environment where trainees can practice techniques and review their performance.\n\nThe application is intended to complement practical welding education and does not replace supervised hands-on welding training, safety instruction, or professional welding certification.\n\nDeveloped by KN Global Innovations Pvt Ltd.", "short_description": "KN Welding Simulator is an immersive VR training platform that lets users practice MIG welding techniques, complete guided welding exercises, and evaluate their performance."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://knglobalinnovations.com/welding-api/privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "KN Global Innovations Pvt. Ltd.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://knglobalinnovations.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"